CodeMemEval (original to OpenDB)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CodeMemEval is an original benchmark created by the OpenDB project
(benchmark/gen_codemem.py). Its ground-truth facts, questions, and answers are
hand-authored; an LLM only renders each fact into a developer/agent transcript.
It follows the LongMemEval JSON schema so it can reuse the same harness, but it
contains no LongMemEval data.
